### Problem Understanding:
The task is to develop a web application using the Gin framework that provides a product recommendation service based on user-specified tags. The application will have two main endpoints: one for retrieving products that match given tags and another for posting new products along with their associated tags. The data will be stored in an SQLite database.

### Summary of the Plan:
